<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Triumph for Shadow Priest DPS Phase 3</h3>
<a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> can be used to purchase way too many things in Phase 3. Notably, you will need them to purchase both <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-808/zabras-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zabra's Regalia</span></a> and <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-143/triumphant-zabras-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Triumphant Zabra's Regalia</span></a>. It is strongly recommended that you do not purchase the item level 232 Tier set, instead, save them to combine with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trophy_argent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trophy of the Crusade</span></a> to buy the 245 Tier. There are also a few head and shoulder pieces available, but none that are worth buying over Tier pieces. On the other hand, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47732/band-of-the-invoker">
